WEBVTT

01:30.230 --> 01:32.896
[Episode 3]

01:44.384 --> 01:46.144
What a lovely young lady.

01:46.144 --> 01:47.504
Fine jade suits you.

01:47.504 --> 01:48.584
Why not try this one?

02:03.424 --> 02:05.304
You don't look like you're from Shazhou.

02:05.304 --> 02:06.784
May I have your name?

02:06.784 --> 02:09.425
I'm Shen Zhi Shu, here looking for a friend.

02:09.425 --> 02:11.224
What does your friend look like?

02:11.224 --> 02:12.224
Let me help you.

02:12.906 --> 02:13.906
He's a young man

02:13.906 --> 02:15.065
with a capital accent.

02:15.065 --> 02:17.585
He's slightly less handsome than me,

02:17.585 --> 02:19.585
a notch below me in grace,

02:19.585 --> 02:22.984
and a tiny bit shorter than me.

02:22.984 --> 02:23.984
Mr. Shen.

02:25.984 --> 02:29.025
Huang, I've finally found you.

02:30.625 --> 02:33.544
From the capital to Shazhou,
you've been keeping busy.

02:37.185 --> 02:40.065
Huang, they're driving me crazy.

02:40.065 --> 02:41.465
I've braved the elements,

02:41.465 --> 02:43.384
crossing mountains and rivers.

02:43.384 --> 02:44.384
Finally...

02:45.345 --> 02:47.065
You found a beauty here.

02:48.504 --> 02:49.585
Why are you here?

02:49.585 --> 02:52.625
Young Master knew you'd arrive now
and sent me over.

02:52.625 --> 02:53.625
Wait.

02:57.625 --> 02:58.745
Where is that beauty?

03:31.105 --> 03:34.104
You didn't escape from the dungeon, did you?

03:34.104 --> 03:36.745
An ordinary dungeon can't hold me.

03:36.745 --> 03:39.905
The Ding family
is searching the whole city for you.

03:39.905 --> 03:42.585
Yet look how bold you are. Why are you here?

03:47.905 --> 03:49.345
To solve your urgent problem.

03:55.905 --> 03:58.704
You? How?

03:58.704 --> 04:00.465
The Heihu Crew owns Jiuyou City.

04:01.384 --> 04:03.264
I know you're investigating the arms

04:03.264 --> 04:06.104
and posing as a wealthy Beijian merchant
to approach Ding Chong.

04:06.104 --> 04:07.944
You're here to obtain evidence

04:07.944 --> 04:12.185
of their collusion with officials
in arms trafficking.

04:12.185 --> 04:15.344
And I know this place inside out

04:15.344 --> 04:16.785
because I grew up here.

04:16.785 --> 04:19.024
I've already uncovered all that.

04:19.024 --> 04:21.144
You're of no use to me now.

04:21.144 --> 04:22.225
On the contrary,

04:22.225 --> 04:24.425
you can't take the Imperial Exam
as a fugitive.

04:24.425 --> 04:27.144
It should be you who needs my help.

04:33.504 --> 04:36.985
Please forgive my ignorance.
I should have known better.

04:37.824 --> 04:41.464
Now I've become a fugitive,
banned from the Imperial Exam.

04:41.464 --> 04:43.666
The official rank matters little.

04:43.666 --> 04:46.425
But I can't lose my right to take the exam.

04:46.425 --> 04:48.305
I believe you are a good official

04:48.305 --> 04:49.584
since you're investigating it.

04:50.225 --> 04:51.824
You need a guide,

04:51.824 --> 04:52.904
and I need a way out.

04:53.745 --> 04:55.824
We each take what we need.

04:55.824 --> 04:58.305
You will put an end
to the corruption in Shazhou

04:58.305 --> 05:00.464
as well as clear my name.

05:00.464 --> 05:01.745
You make a valid point.

05:03.305 --> 05:05.425
But I can't get you into the city.

05:05.425 --> 05:07.065
I only have one travel permit,

05:07.065 --> 05:09.545
which I bought at a high price
from Ding Chong.

05:09.545 --> 05:10.545
What a coincidence.

05:12.464 --> 05:13.625
I also have one.

05:19.145 --> 05:22.065
You're so good at picking pockets.

05:22.786 --> 05:25.024
Have you honed such a skill since childhood?

05:26.704 --> 05:27.785
It's for survival.

05:36.344 --> 05:39.264
Since you can forge it, why steal mine?

05:44.384 --> 05:47.024
Jiuyou City opens up every seven days.

05:47.024 --> 05:48.665
To prevent counterfeiting,

05:48.665 --> 05:52.665
they draw a different pattern on the permit
every seven days.

06:03.384 --> 06:05.464
You are so multi-talented.

06:08.985 --> 06:10.464
You are a skilled martial artist.

06:11.584 --> 06:15.105
I will keep the genuine travel permit.

06:18.985 --> 06:20.264
Giving me the fake one?

06:20.865 --> 06:23.144
You always keep a way out for yourself.

06:31.105 --> 06:33.785
It's time. Let's go.

06:36.144 --> 06:37.625
Everyone in Shazhou

06:37.625 --> 06:38.745
complies with the Heihu Crew.

06:39.625 --> 06:41.504
This place is devoid of justice.

06:41.504 --> 06:43.426
Murder and arson happen all the time.

06:43.426 --> 06:46.024
Those are merchants
who couldn't pay protection fees.

06:46.944 --> 06:48.305
See the green light in the skeleton?

06:48.944 --> 06:51.785
The Heihu Crew makes those people's skulls
into everlasting lamps.

06:51.785 --> 06:52.824
The deeper the resentment...

06:52.824 --> 06:54.144
Keep up.

06:54.144 --> 06:55.144
The brighter the glow.

06:55.944 --> 06:58.384
Sneaking in
with a travel permit from seven days ago?

07:06.745 --> 07:07.745
Get in.

07:11.425 --> 07:12.425
Get in.

07:30.264 --> 07:31.264
Go on.

07:35.665 --> 07:36.665
Get in.

07:47.144 --> 07:48.504
Come on, guys.

07:48.504 --> 07:50.504
Someone is selling trade permits.

07:50.504 --> 07:52.105
Don't miss out on it.

07:52.105 --> 07:53.785
Let's go. Hurry.

07:55.106 --> 07:57.545
Trade permits
are issued by the imperial court

07:57.545 --> 07:59.704
and verified and filed by the prefects.

07:59.704 --> 08:02.545
They are only for veteran merchants
with outstanding reputations.

08:03.545 --> 08:04.944
How do they have them?

08:06.824 --> 08:11.425
Even strictly controlled items
like salt and iron are openly sold here.

08:11.425 --> 08:12.824
Let alone a piece of paper.

08:13.545 --> 08:16.504
Ding Chong is insatiable,
auctioning the trade permits

08:16.504 --> 08:17.704
to extremely high prices.

08:18.745 --> 08:22.185
The Yan family offended him
and had their papers withheld for six months.

08:22.185 --> 08:25.745
It took them two chests of gold
to redeem those trade permits.

08:25.745 --> 08:27.144
The court opened border trade

08:27.144 --> 08:28.985
to benefit the border people,

08:28.985 --> 08:31.464
but the parasites
are amassing wealth through it.

08:56.185 --> 08:59.185
You won't find such quality elsewhere.
All good stuff.

09:00.665 --> 09:03.624
Take a look. All good stuff.

09:09.385 --> 09:11.145
Why isn't anyone dealing arms?

09:12.905 --> 09:15.344
It's a serious matter,
involving the military.

09:15.344 --> 09:17.785
Even Ding Chong wouldn't dare do it openly.

09:17.785 --> 09:20.944
His backer in the military
is probably even more cautious.

09:21.704 --> 09:22.704
Mr. He.

09:24.704 --> 09:28.305
What would you do without me as your guide?

09:28.305 --> 09:29.824
I have my own ways.

09:31.105 --> 09:33.665
But seeing you so confident,

09:33.665 --> 09:36.824
I'd like to know your plan.

09:36.824 --> 09:37.824
Follow me.

09:49.905 --> 09:51.305
Walking the path with a lamp,

09:51.305 --> 09:54.145
is it light or dark?

09:56.185 --> 09:58.025
With mist obscuring the way,

09:58.025 --> 09:59.704
I follow the crowd,

09:59.704 --> 10:01.025
not speaking of light or dark.

10:03.824 --> 10:04.824
Miss Meng.

10:06.104 --> 10:10.624
The young man you brought this time
is far better than those previous ones.

10:14.065 --> 10:15.744
But he looks so grumpy.

10:15.744 --> 10:18.104
Anyone would think he's a debt collector.

10:19.425 --> 10:21.224
He doesn't just look grumpy.

10:21.224 --> 10:22.464
He has a bad temper.

10:23.224 --> 10:24.905
Arrogant and conceited,

10:24.905 --> 10:26.744
looking down on everyone,

10:26.744 --> 10:27.785
and self-important.

10:31.104 --> 10:34.624
My distinguished guest,
what would you like to inquire about?

10:34.624 --> 10:36.305
There is nothing

10:36.305 --> 10:38.344
I don't know about Shazhou.

10:41.145 --> 10:44.744
I want to buy arms from the Heihu Crew.
Can you show us the way?

10:45.864 --> 10:48.665
<i>He even found out
the arms are with the Heihu Crew.</i>

10:52.545 --> 10:53.905
Arms trade

10:56.065 --> 10:57.584
is a dangerous line of work.

11:10.185 --> 11:12.905
Forget it. I'll look elsewhere.

11:14.825 --> 11:17.025
You do have a bad temper.

11:17.025 --> 11:19.305
I'll show you the way right now.

11:27.744 --> 11:31.065
As they say, money makes the world go around.

11:31.065 --> 11:34.065
It's more like,
"The native always has the edge."

11:34.065 --> 11:36.545
Without me, we don't know what you would...

11:37.425 --> 11:38.425
We're here.

11:47.385 --> 11:49.665
Mr. Feng gave instructions long ago.

11:49.665 --> 11:52.624
If you mind your own business in Jiuyou City,

11:52.624 --> 11:54.185
you're an honored guest.

11:54.185 --> 11:57.065
But if you act suspiciously
and plot anything,

11:58.385 --> 11:59.785
we'll send you on your way.

12:09.624 --> 12:11.505
Are you fine, Miss Meng?

12:30.065 --> 12:31.344
Are you fine, Mr. He?

12:33.944 --> 12:35.984
What a fine guide you found, Miss Meng.

12:35.984 --> 12:38.224
He certainly pointed us to a unique path.

12:38.224 --> 12:39.505
Stop being sarcastic.

12:40.824 --> 12:44.025
You had to mention the arms trade
and gave us away.

13:05.905 --> 13:07.265
This cave is sealed shut.

13:09.745 --> 13:12.385
We're not going to die here, right?

13:12.385 --> 13:15.464
Since I brought you here,
I won't let anything happen to you.

13:17.864 --> 13:18.864
What's that sound?

13:33.425 --> 13:34.425
Be careful.

13:35.785 --> 13:37.265
The banded krait is deadly.

13:45.584 --> 13:47.025
A master like you

13:48.344 --> 13:49.425
is afraid of a little snake?

13:50.464 --> 13:51.505
Of course not.

13:52.584 --> 13:54.425
I'm afraid of its venom.

13:54.425 --> 13:55.425
Well, I'm not.

14:20.625 --> 14:23.065
You have so many tricks up your sleeve.

14:24.265 --> 14:25.984
You promised to keep me safe.

14:29.185 --> 14:30.385
I'm counting on you.

14:54.145 --> 14:55.145
Low on phosphorus powder.

14:56.145 --> 14:57.145
Talisman paper.

15:26.265 --> 15:27.265
Let's go.

15:33.824 --> 15:34.824
There's a draft.

16:00.824 --> 16:01.824
Cheers.

16:01.824 --> 16:02.824
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

16:09.265 --> 16:11.624
Luckily, my buddy Ding Chong
is one step ahead.

16:11.624 --> 16:15.104
That He fellow
posed as a rich merchant to spy on us.

16:15.744 --> 16:17.624
I bet he has a death wish.

16:17.624 --> 16:20.624
Exactly. He thinks he's so capable.

16:20.624 --> 16:24.425
He didn't know
Governor Ding had already looked into them.

16:24.425 --> 16:28.065
Those two should be dead
in the snake pit by now.

16:28.065 --> 16:30.104
Of course.

16:30.104 --> 16:33.065
No one has ever come out of there alive.

16:34.065 --> 16:38.385
They want to infiltrate us?
Let them come. We'll bury them here.

16:38.385 --> 16:39.385
Buddies.

16:39.385 --> 16:42.305
The snake pit connects underground
to the Heihu Crew.

16:42.305 --> 16:44.224
It saved us quite a bit of effort.

16:45.265 --> 16:48.025
That scar-face is Feng Lu,
the leader of the Heihu Crew.

16:49.344 --> 16:52.505
They have numbers. We can only outwit them.

16:52.505 --> 16:53.984
Capture the leader first.

16:58.984 --> 17:01.984
Guys, keep drinking.

17:01.984 --> 17:03.745
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

17:28.465 --> 17:30.225
Is there a fire?

17:49.465 --> 17:52.904
Master, I think I saw him.

17:52.904 --> 17:53.904
Who?

17:55.065 --> 17:56.065
Who is it?

17:56.065 --> 17:57.065
Don't move.

17:58.745 --> 17:59.745
Master.

18:01.785 --> 18:04.584
Come closer if you want your master dead.

18:06.945 --> 18:09.985
Young man,
I know you're investigating the arms.

18:11.384 --> 18:14.505
But going against the Heihu Crew
is going against Governor Ding.

18:14.505 --> 18:17.584
The consequences are more than you can bear.

18:17.584 --> 18:18.584
Mr. Feng.

18:19.945 --> 18:22.025
Be it the Heihu Crew or Ding Chong,

18:22.705 --> 18:24.785
do you really think I care?

18:45.465 --> 18:46.624
Salt, medicinal herbs,

18:46.624 --> 18:47.785
tea, porcelain...

18:47.785 --> 18:49.904
Here are the transaction details
of Jiuyou City.

18:50.545 --> 18:54.344
The profit from porcelain alone
accounts for a year's tax revenue of Shazhou.

18:57.504 --> 18:59.065
[Distribution of spoils]

18:59.065 --> 19:00.384
The division of the spoils is quite clear.

19:01.225 --> 19:03.344
One share each
for the Heihu Crew and Ding Chong,

19:03.344 --> 19:04.664
and the last one just says

19:04.664 --> 19:06.305
"for military".

19:07.265 --> 19:10.184
Too afraid to write down that person's name?

19:10.184 --> 19:12.065
You're so rampant in arms trading.

19:12.065 --> 19:16.184
I imagine the person colluding with you
has a high rank in the army.

19:18.065 --> 19:20.624
Just the two of you want to interrogate me?

19:25.424 --> 19:27.305
Confess now.

19:27.305 --> 19:29.664
Why don't you figure it out yourself?

19:32.785 --> 19:34.424
Since we've found the ledger,

19:34.424 --> 19:36.705
naturally it's all your doing.

19:38.824 --> 19:42.465
Feng Lu set up registration fees
for the women's exam without permission,

19:42.465 --> 19:44.025
manipulated the Jiuyou City market,

19:44.025 --> 19:45.945
selling trade permits,

19:45.945 --> 19:47.664
extorting the merchants...

19:47.664 --> 19:49.265
Stop talking nonsense!

19:49.265 --> 19:51.104
I didn't do any of that.

19:51.104 --> 19:52.864
I only kill people.

19:52.864 --> 19:54.705
Feng Lu alone trafficked arms

19:54.705 --> 19:55.864
with military personnel.

19:56.584 --> 19:58.664
I don't even know where the military camp is.

19:58.664 --> 19:59.664
It was Wang...

20:02.745 --> 20:03.824
Wang Qi.

20:04.465 --> 20:06.265
The military governor of Shazhou.

20:06.265 --> 20:08.265
He's been here for years
and has some prestige.

20:08.265 --> 20:11.104
He's been stationed here
since the previous reign

20:11.104 --> 20:13.824
and has made great achievements
with General Gao Meng.

20:14.505 --> 20:16.344
Throughout those years of duty

20:16.344 --> 20:19.184
with so many subordinates to support,

20:19.184 --> 20:22.705
he's probably just a businessman now,
rather than a general.

20:22.705 --> 20:26.144
It seems you have a deep understanding
of humans' greedy nature.

20:26.144 --> 20:29.945
So Mr. Feng bribed Wang Qi.

20:29.945 --> 20:31.785
I said I didn't do anything.

20:31.785 --> 20:33.424
Who doesn't want money these days?

20:34.584 --> 20:37.864
Who'd turn down a profitable business
like arms trading?

20:37.864 --> 20:41.824
Wang Qi and Ding Chong go way back.

20:41.824 --> 20:43.705
Ding Chong told Wang Qi,

20:43.705 --> 20:50.424
"Even the sturdiest armor
can't withstand the arrow of gold."

20:50.424 --> 20:53.065
[Testimony]
Here is the testimony you just gave.

20:53.864 --> 20:56.145
Sign and put your handprint
if there's no problem.

20:56.145 --> 20:57.384
I can't read.

20:58.864 --> 21:01.144
[Feng Lu]
I just signed it for you. Take it.

21:02.985 --> 21:04.785
Come on, put your handprint.

21:12.904 --> 21:17.265
You act with such decisiveness,
rivaling even the Ministry of Justice.

21:17.265 --> 21:18.265
Mr. He.

21:18.904 --> 21:20.265
We have the testimony.

21:20.265 --> 21:22.065
All we need is the arms ledger.

21:23.785 --> 21:25.745
Who bought the arms from you?

21:25.745 --> 21:28.144
Where is the real arms ledger?

21:28.144 --> 21:30.104
I don't know the buyers.

21:30.104 --> 21:32.305
I've never seen the arms ledger.

21:32.305 --> 21:34.184
Our Heihu Crew is just a courier.

21:34.824 --> 21:38.065
We deliver goods for money, hand to hand.

21:38.065 --> 21:40.945
Still trying to protect Ding Chong
at this point?

21:40.945 --> 21:42.344
If you're in trouble,

21:42.344 --> 21:45.104
the first thing he'll do is kill you.

21:45.104 --> 21:46.344
Once you're dead,

21:46.344 --> 21:48.584
he will slaughter all your buddies.

21:48.584 --> 21:50.664
He can easily
find ten other helpers like you.

21:58.584 --> 22:00.344
Greetings, Governor Ding.

22:00.344 --> 22:02.225
Governor Ding, someone caught our master.

22:02.225 --> 22:03.945
Please save him.

22:03.945 --> 22:06.664
- Is everyone here?
- Yes.

22:06.664 --> 22:10.144
Good. Charge with me.

22:10.144 --> 22:13.785
Alright, guys. Charge in to save our master!

22:13.785 --> 22:15.305
- Charge in!
- Let's go!

22:27.824 --> 22:28.824
Sixth Master!

22:31.705 --> 22:34.505
The Heihu Crew trafficked arms

22:34.505 --> 22:35.864
and committed heinous crimes.

22:35.864 --> 22:39.785
Today, I'm here to annihilate them,
carrying out heaven's justice.

22:39.785 --> 22:41.065
Spare no one.

22:42.824 --> 22:43.824
Master.

22:44.465 --> 22:48.664
That traitor Ding Chong
brought troops to encircle us.

22:48.664 --> 22:51.144
Our guys are either dead or injured.

22:51.144 --> 22:53.624
Ding Chong came even faster than I thought.

22:55.265 --> 22:57.104
My buddies.

22:58.225 --> 23:01.065
Ding Chong, you filthy traitor!

23:01.065 --> 23:02.705
I'm going to kill him!

23:02.705 --> 23:05.424
Hand over the real ledger,
and I'll spare your life.

23:06.065 --> 23:07.824
It's under my bed.

23:09.065 --> 23:10.144
Let me go.

23:22.785 --> 23:24.184
He has some backbone.

23:27.904 --> 23:29.144
Why did Ding Chong come?

23:39.466 --> 23:42.705
You personally
delivered the order for Lord Xu.

23:42.705 --> 23:45.265
I am truly flattered.

23:47.505 --> 23:49.066
Lord Xu sent me here

23:49.066 --> 23:51.945
to save your life for old time's sake.

23:52.624 --> 23:54.864
I am dull-witted. Please enlighten me.

23:59.265 --> 24:03.864
The court has sent secret envoys to Shazhou
to investigate the arms trafficking.

24:05.144 --> 24:06.945
Could it be that He fellow?

24:08.785 --> 24:10.225
Lord Xu said

24:10.225 --> 24:12.305
that if you want to come out unscathed,

24:12.305 --> 24:14.545
you'd better get rid of the Heihu Crew soon.

24:18.945 --> 24:23.305
Then you can pin everything on them.

24:23.305 --> 24:26.705
After all, dead men
can't cry out their grievances.

24:29.864 --> 24:31.584
Lord Xu is far-sighted.

24:32.505 --> 24:35.144
I share the very same view as him.

24:35.945 --> 24:37.505
I'll handle it immediately.

25:14.664 --> 25:16.065
Ding Chong!

25:31.265 --> 25:33.864
Three years ago, you injured your leg.

25:33.864 --> 25:38.384
If I hadn't carried you
from Qingzhou to Shazhou,

25:38.384 --> 25:40.785
the wolves would have eaten you up.

25:43.466 --> 25:47.305
All these years,
I've treated you like a brother.

25:48.144 --> 25:52.065
But you killed all of my buddies.

25:52.065 --> 25:55.144
Feng, if you're my brother,
just do me this favor.

25:55.745 --> 25:58.785
You have to die for me to live.

25:58.785 --> 26:00.265
Ding Chong!

26:12.584 --> 26:16.025
- Surround this place. Leave no one alive.
- Understood.

26:16.025 --> 26:17.025
Stop, all of you.

26:20.664 --> 26:22.065
Mr. Shen.

26:22.065 --> 26:23.904
The Heihu Crew is steeped in evil.

26:23.904 --> 26:26.065
I've executed their leader Feng Lu.

26:27.745 --> 26:28.745
Cousin.

26:29.425 --> 26:31.785
Are you hurt?

26:31.785 --> 26:33.184
I'm fine.

26:33.184 --> 26:34.305
How dare you, Ding Chong!

26:34.305 --> 26:36.664
Your crimes are monstrous. Surrender now!

26:36.664 --> 26:37.664
Seize him.

26:40.824 --> 26:41.824
Mr. Shen.

26:41.824 --> 26:43.225
Is there some misunderstanding?

26:43.225 --> 26:44.225
Huang Bo.

26:46.584 --> 26:47.904
Ding Chong,

26:47.904 --> 26:49.384
as a court official,

26:49.384 --> 26:52.424
you colluded with the Heihu Crew
to traffic arms for personal gain

26:52.424 --> 26:54.025
and killed witnesses.

26:54.785 --> 26:56.025
Killing you ten times

26:56.025 --> 26:58.624
still wouldn't quell the people's hatred.

26:58.624 --> 26:59.624
Who are you?

27:00.344 --> 27:02.785
I can see you hold a high position.

27:03.424 --> 27:05.424
All crows are equally black.

27:05.424 --> 27:07.305
Why must we give each other a hard time?

27:07.305 --> 27:09.745
Tell me what you want.

27:09.745 --> 27:12.745
Let me go,
and I'll give you 10,000 taels of gold.

27:12.745 --> 27:15.745
No amount of gold can redeem your sin.

27:15.745 --> 27:17.424
Ding Chong has been arrested.

27:17.424 --> 27:18.985
Before it gets out of control,

27:18.985 --> 27:22.705
lay down your weapons,
and you still get to atone for your crimes.

27:22.705 --> 27:25.904
But if you continue to resist,
you'll be considered his accomplice.

27:25.904 --> 27:26.904
Hurry up.

27:29.305 --> 27:32.384
Take Ding Chong and the others back
for interrogation.

27:32.384 --> 27:33.824
Locate the arms.

27:35.785 --> 27:37.265
Mr. Shen.

27:37.265 --> 27:38.265
Mr. Shen.

27:40.624 --> 27:41.624
Protect the young master.

27:53.664 --> 27:55.225
Huang Bo, get that person.

27:55.225 --> 27:56.225
Understood.

28:01.785 --> 28:04.864
Such penetration.
It must be forged from refined iron.

28:04.864 --> 28:07.424
The same material
as the army's smuggled arrows.

28:07.424 --> 28:10.184
Are they melting down the arms
to reforge weaponry?

28:10.184 --> 28:13.384
Only an insider could kill Ding Chong
at the perfect time.

28:13.384 --> 28:15.065
In that real arms ledger,

28:15.065 --> 28:17.505
a huge quantity of arms is unaccounted for.

28:17.505 --> 28:21.184
That person in black
is probably connected to the arms buyer.

28:26.664 --> 28:28.745
The pattern is quite distinctive.

28:31.785 --> 28:34.624
We must look into
this person and the crossbow bolt.

28:34.624 --> 28:35.624
Governor.

28:40.545 --> 28:41.545
Governor.

28:41.545 --> 28:42.545
Take him away.

28:45.226 --> 28:46.226
Take everyone back.

28:46.226 --> 28:48.104
- Let me go!
- Leave no one behind.

28:48.104 --> 28:50.104
- Move.
- Governor.

28:50.104 --> 28:51.104
- Move.
- Move.

29:07.785 --> 29:11.025
Ding Chong is dead.
You are no longer a fugitive.

29:11.025 --> 29:13.465
I'll have Mr. Shen redocument your dossier

29:13.465 --> 29:14.705
for the Imperial Exam.

29:16.985 --> 29:20.025
Now, we're finally even.

29:33.305 --> 29:35.305
Run. They're here to confiscate everything.

29:38.305 --> 29:39.305
Put it here.

29:43.384 --> 29:44.384
Hurry up.

29:55.465 --> 29:56.904
Mother, what's going on?

29:56.904 --> 29:57.904
Keep it down.

30:00.065 --> 30:01.144
Your uncle is dead.

30:01.144 --> 30:03.184
People are getting arrested everywhere.

30:03.184 --> 30:05.265
Change into these and come with me.

30:05.904 --> 30:09.384
This is hideous. I won't wear it.

30:09.384 --> 30:10.465
I'd rather die.

30:12.384 --> 30:13.864
Do as I say or you'll die.

30:15.904 --> 30:16.904
Put it on.

30:20.945 --> 30:21.945
Hurry.

30:24.904 --> 30:26.545
It stinks.

30:26.545 --> 30:28.025
We're running out of time! Hurry!

30:34.624 --> 30:35.624
Hurry.

30:35.624 --> 30:37.424
Alright.

30:46.745 --> 30:47.745
Your Majesty.

30:47.745 --> 30:50.584
Wang Qi and the generals in Shazhou
have been arrested.

30:50.584 --> 30:52.506
Evidence and testimonies have been stored.

30:52.506 --> 30:55.785
Seal the news
and escort them secretly back to the capital.

30:55.785 --> 30:58.785
- Must keep this from the Left Chancellor.
- Understood.

30:58.785 --> 30:59.824
Your Majesty.

30:59.824 --> 31:01.505
Ding Chong's gang has been wiped out.

31:01.505 --> 31:04.584
His properties in Jiuyou City
have all been sealed.

31:04.584 --> 31:06.745
All involved merchants have been punished

31:06.745 --> 31:08.265
according to the law.

31:08.265 --> 31:10.225
It was a huge success.

31:10.225 --> 31:12.424
Your Majesty,
we should head back to the capital.

31:12.424 --> 31:15.184
Lord Xu's deadline is only three days away.

31:15.184 --> 31:17.104
Are you telling me to obey him?

31:17.104 --> 31:19.505
I wouldn't dare.
We follow Your Majesty's orders.

31:21.505 --> 31:24.664
Your father, Grand Tutor Shen,
is going to supervise the Provincial Exam.

31:24.664 --> 31:25.945
He should be here soon.

31:26.745 --> 31:29.864
I need to discuss the matters
with him in detail.

31:29.864 --> 31:31.864
After that, we'll depart overnight.

31:31.864 --> 31:33.824
Then we'll surely arrive in time.

31:37.344 --> 31:39.144
And keep a close eye

31:39.144 --> 31:41.785
on Meng Ting Hui's grade
in the Imperial Exam.

31:42.584 --> 31:45.904
Your Majesty, have you taken a fancy to her?

31:45.904 --> 31:46.904
Taken a fancy?

31:49.584 --> 31:51.265
She swindles, cheats,

31:51.265 --> 31:53.104
plays tricks, and acts like a rogue.

31:53.904 --> 31:54.945
It's hard not to be impressed.

31:54.945 --> 31:57.705
Your Majesty's intention is fully understood.

31:57.705 --> 31:59.344
I will certainly

31:59.344 --> 32:02.184
prevent such a hooligan
from entering the court.

32:03.545 --> 32:06.904
Huang, you're really getting better
at guessing His Majesty's intentions.

32:06.904 --> 32:08.344
I've been serving His Majesty for years.

32:09.384 --> 32:11.384
I mean to say that her street wisdom

32:11.384 --> 32:14.226
sometimes works better
than high principles in court.

32:14.226 --> 32:17.225
His Majesty fancies her.
Don't you understand?

32:17.225 --> 32:20.265
Huang Bo, do you remember this place?

32:20.265 --> 32:22.025
Ten years ago, there was a great drought

32:22.025 --> 32:23.384
where sandstorms raged.

32:23.384 --> 32:24.545
To fix the sand,

32:24.545 --> 32:26.584
Your Majesty brought people to plant poplars.

32:26.584 --> 32:28.584
Now, the desert has given way to greenery.

32:28.584 --> 32:30.225
Every time I come to Shazhou,

32:30.225 --> 32:32.705
the things I experience get more thrilling.

32:33.384 --> 32:36.624
Do you remember the girl
who stole my jade pendant?

32:52.144 --> 32:54.705
Yes, I remember her. She was coerced.

32:55.465 --> 32:56.705
Because of her,

32:56.705 --> 32:59.505
Your Majesty
took down the child trafficking gang.

33:34.424 --> 33:35.545
Xiang, have this.

33:46.265 --> 33:47.465
Let's go.

33:47.465 --> 33:48.545
Where to?

33:48.545 --> 33:49.945
Bofeng.

33:49.945 --> 33:52.225
I heard Bofeng
is a new restaurant in Shazhou.

33:52.225 --> 33:54.305
The lamb noodles are a local specialty.

33:54.305 --> 33:56.226
I'd been observing a vegetarian diet
on your behalf

33:56.226 --> 33:57.344
before I traveled all the way here.

33:57.344 --> 34:00.025
I have starved so much that I've lost weight.

34:00.025 --> 34:01.705
How come I don't see it?

34:17.545 --> 34:20.184
Master, Ding Chong and Feng Lu are dead.

34:20.184 --> 34:23.385
Those greedy Ning Empire lackeys
have become useless.

34:23.385 --> 34:24.505
I don't care if they died.

34:24.505 --> 34:27.545
Master, we may have
acquired some weapons over the years,

34:27.545 --> 34:29.345
but it's far from enough.

34:29.345 --> 34:33.025
Now that we've lost this channel,
we may have to find another way.

34:33.025 --> 34:35.825
Our top priority is to hide our tracks.

34:35.825 --> 34:38.385
No one shall discover who we are.

34:38.385 --> 34:39.385
Understood.

34:40.104 --> 34:43.584
I think the days of the Ning Empire
are numbered.

35:06.985 --> 35:08.345
Fire!

35:08.345 --> 35:10.304
Guards. Put out the fire!

35:10.304 --> 35:11.385
Meng, it's me.

35:13.905 --> 35:16.425
Fu Zhi, what are you doing?

35:16.425 --> 35:18.224
Luck hasn't been on our side.

35:18.224 --> 35:19.425
I'm repelling your bad luck.

35:20.184 --> 35:21.184
Repelling my bad luck?

35:21.784 --> 35:23.985
Meng, you're amazing.

35:23.985 --> 35:26.465
Shazhou is finally going to see justice done.

35:26.465 --> 35:29.184
It's just that Jiang Mei Er disappeared.

35:29.184 --> 35:30.425
She got off easy.

35:30.425 --> 35:32.065
Heaven will deal with the wicked.

35:32.065 --> 35:35.025
Fu Zhi, can you take this away first?

35:35.025 --> 35:36.825
I have good news for you.

35:36.825 --> 35:38.584
Bofeng is finally mine.

35:38.584 --> 35:39.784
Business is booming.

35:39.784 --> 35:41.425
Xi Er and Hai Tang are overwhelmed.

35:41.425 --> 35:43.545
My father canceled that awful engagement.

35:43.545 --> 35:45.825
You should see my stepmother's face.

35:45.825 --> 35:47.744
She looked like
she had swallowed a hundred flies.

35:49.905 --> 35:52.425
I'll go to Bofeng with you
and wait for Mr. He.

35:53.065 --> 35:54.624
He's holding my dossier.

35:54.624 --> 35:56.825
I can't be at ease until I get it back.

35:56.825 --> 35:59.304
- Right.
- Take it away.

35:59.304 --> 36:01.744
No way. We're removing bad luck.

36:04.425 --> 36:06.425
Come on, left hand.

36:07.065 --> 36:08.425
Right hand.

36:08.425 --> 36:09.664
Left foot.

36:09.664 --> 36:10.664
Turn around.

36:12.345 --> 36:13.385
Fu Zhi.

36:46.945 --> 36:47.945
My dossier.

36:57.985 --> 36:59.545
Shouldn't you buy me a meal?

37:19.025 --> 37:21.425
To enjoy lamb noodles, drink the soup first.

37:21.425 --> 37:24.184
Warm soup really whets the appetite.

37:29.545 --> 37:32.264
Okay, I'll try.

38:10.664 --> 38:14.184
I've come to Shazhou before,
but I never knew this delicacy.

38:14.184 --> 38:16.825
Try this, a Shazhou specialty.

38:17.985 --> 38:19.664
You've been here before?

38:22.784 --> 38:25.704
I came in a hurry
and didn't have time for sightseeing.

38:26.505 --> 38:29.304
We had a rough start,
but now we know each other.

38:29.304 --> 38:32.545
I brought your dossier.
One bowl of noodles is not enough.

38:32.545 --> 38:34.465
I'm returning to the capital soon.

38:34.465 --> 38:37.304
I wonder if you'd be willing
to show me around.

38:38.664 --> 38:40.304
The Provincial Exam is imminent.

38:40.304 --> 38:41.545
Every second counts.

38:42.865 --> 38:44.304
I need to study.

38:44.304 --> 38:47.025
Without the dossier, how are you...

38:56.584 --> 38:58.304
You're quite something.

39:00.624 --> 39:01.624
Where should we go?

39:02.784 --> 39:04.224
Can you ride a horse?

39:25.905 --> 39:28.784
Miss Meng, your riding is truly impressive.

39:28.784 --> 39:30.945
Galloping across the vast desert

39:30.945 --> 39:32.264
feels so free.

39:33.025 --> 39:34.624
You're brave, resourceful,

39:34.624 --> 39:36.704
and full of life wisdom.

39:36.704 --> 39:39.825
I'm curious about your upbringing.

39:46.784 --> 39:48.184
I had no parents

39:49.704 --> 39:51.104
and was abducted by traffickers.

39:51.905 --> 39:53.784
They taught me to steal and cheat

39:54.385 --> 39:55.545
to make money for them.

39:56.744 --> 40:00.945
My "bravery and resourcefulness"
are only necessities for survival.

40:03.545 --> 40:06.104
A beating would be getting off easy.

40:07.545 --> 40:10.425
I could have died.

40:35.224 --> 40:38.505
You little brat, you want to kill me?

40:49.865 --> 40:51.865
Xiang, run!

40:57.224 --> 40:59.584
Miss Meng, what's on your mind?

41:05.224 --> 41:06.385
Just the past.

41:08.825 --> 41:11.584
Shazhou is a place of bright sunshine,

41:12.744 --> 41:13.905
yet lacks justice.

41:15.465 --> 41:16.744
Officials do nothing.

41:17.385 --> 41:19.144
I'm taking the Imperial Exam

41:19.144 --> 41:20.945
not only to protect myself,

41:20.945 --> 41:22.065
but also to hold power,

41:22.665 --> 41:25.545
so that the wicked
can't oppress the common people.

41:26.905 --> 41:28.264
You have a great ambition.

41:29.624 --> 41:31.104
I can offer you a shortcut.

41:31.104 --> 41:35.065
My uncle, Grand Tutor Shen,
is coming to preside over the exam.

41:35.065 --> 41:38.104
Why don't we ask Mr. Shen to introduce you?

41:38.104 --> 41:41.184
Everyone knows Grand Tutor Shen
is a man of integrity.

41:42.545 --> 41:44.744
But you offered to introduce me to him.

41:45.905 --> 41:49.264
Why does it sound like you're setting me up?

41:50.466 --> 41:52.985
When it comes to setting people up,
you're the expert.

41:54.224 --> 41:58.144
It's just that you helped me
take down the corrupt officials and the gang.

41:58.985 --> 42:01.664
I have no way to repay you,
so I'll lend you a hand.

42:03.345 --> 42:04.584
Look at that tree.

42:04.584 --> 42:07.065
It knows how to grow by leaning on the dune.

42:07.065 --> 42:09.945
That's why they grow
much taller than the poplars.

42:11.144 --> 42:14.825
Sometimes going with the flow
is the way to break the deadlock.

42:16.224 --> 42:20.465
The way of survival in the desert
isn't about who's taller,

42:20.465 --> 42:22.304
but whose roots are deeper.

42:23.584 --> 42:25.545
I know my place.

42:25.545 --> 42:28.665
Having a friend like you in the capital

42:28.665 --> 42:30.304
would be adding wings to a tiger.

42:31.184 --> 42:32.744
But I prefer to make it all by myself.

42:33.345 --> 42:34.505
May everything go

42:35.945 --> 42:37.184
as you wish, then.

42:42.425 --> 42:43.505
To the rightful owner.

42:44.385 --> 42:47.385
Consider this a thank-you gift
for helping me solve the case.

42:49.185 --> 42:51.825
We've finally settled our accounts.

42:52.784 --> 42:54.104
Don't put me in debt again.

43:02.825 --> 43:03.825
Miss Meng.

43:05.825 --> 43:06.825
Until we meet again.

43:07.825 --> 43:10.744
If we're meant to meet again, we will.
